<title>HUNGARY: CESI index advances to finish at 1,517.79 points.</title>
<headline>CESI index advances to finish at 1,517.79 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index rose on Wednesday to end at 1,517.79 points, up 16.26 points or 1.08 percent, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
